  "content": "<h3>&nbsp;</h3><h1>Fresh &amp; Smooth</h1><p>這是一個專注於模組與材質包的<strong>模組包</strong>，旨在<strong>讓遊戲更生動</strong>，並盡可能帶來清新（流暢）的體驗。<br><br><span style=\"color:#f00\"><strong>1.21.6</strong></span> 版本有時會崩潰，為獲得最佳穩定性，請改用 <span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong><span style=\"color:#008000;text-decoration:underline\">1.21.5</span></strong></span><br><br>此版本缺少「附魔輪廓」模組，請手動安裝於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchantment-glint-outline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Better Outlines 模組</a><br><br>你也可以在 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fenchantment-glint-outline\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 上遊玩此模組包。<br><br></p><h2>感謝未收錄於 Modrinth 生態系的模組：</h2><ul>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.planetminecraft.com%252ftexture-pack%252faction-s-amp-stuff-pumpkin-no-blur%252f\" rel=\"nofollow\">Action and stuff pumpkins</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fresourcepack%252fvisual-effects-plus\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Visual Effects+</a></li>\n</ul><h2><br>靈感來源是什麼？</h2><p>此計畫的主要<strong>靈感</strong>來自兩個附加包：<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%253fid%253d61c7a786-d7ad-49e0-a710-817121cd9795\" rel=\"nofollow\">Actions &amp; Stuff</a></strong> 和 <strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%253fid%253d2249c366-c812-4fe5-a6ec-abe9d6bea6bc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Realistic Biomes</a>。</strong></p><p>此模組包支援 <strong>1.21.5</strong> 和 <strong>1.21.6</strong> 的 <strong>Fabric</strong> 版本；考量到模組數量，效能幾乎保證穩定流暢，無需擔心。</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_srPykohHSQ\" width=\"806\" height=\"861\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p><p><br><br>這是一個專注於模組與材質包，讓遊戲動起來並帶來清新（流暢）感受的模組包。</p><p>此計畫的主要靈感來自兩個附加包：&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%253fid%253d61c7a786-d7ad-49e0-a710-817121cd9795\" rel=\"nofollow\">Actions &amp; Stuff</a>&nbsp;和&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fwww.minecraft.net%252fen-us%252fmarketplace%252fpdp%253fid%253d2249c366-c812-4fe5-a6ec-abe9d6bea6bc\" rel=\"nofollow\">Realistic Biomes</a>。</p><p>此模組包支援 1.20.1 與 1.21.1 的 Fabric 版本（Forge 版本也即將推出）；考量到模組數量，效能幾乎保證穩定流暢，無需擔心。</p><p><br><br><span><span><iframe style=\"width:622px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/Tq6TZfTmhZA\" width=\"622\" height=\"362\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>",
